 ('There are ___ chairs in the room.', 'several', 'much', 'little', 'a little', 'Chairs terhitung jamak → several.'),
 ('___ of the employees attended the training.', 'Most', 'Much', 'Little', 'Every', 'Most of + jamak.'),
 ('He decided ___ the job.', 'to accept', 'accepting', 'accept', 'accepted', 'Decide + to V1.'),
 ('Thank you for ___ us.', 'helping', 'help', 'to help', 'helped', 'Preposisi + V-ing.'),
